  @{ slug="houston"; name="Houston"; abbr="TX"; programs="rental and flip"; angle="Houston's size and diverse neighborhoods give investors a wide range of price points for rentals and flips. Property taxes are a meaningful part of the payment, so a DSCR calculation should always include them." }
  @{ slug="dallas"; name="Dallas"; abbr="TX"; programs="rental, flip and new construction"; angle="Dallas-Fort Worth continues to attract rental investors, builders and flippers, with new construction active throughout the metro. High property taxes make full-payment math important on rentals." }
